# The client portal is a client-rendered SPA: its routes are never prerendered,
# so there is no static file to serve. Rewrite (200, not redirect) to the bare
# shell and let React Router take over in the browser. All project data arrives
# via authenticated /api/portal/* calls.
#
# /api/* is untouched: Pages Functions take precedence over these rules.
/portal          /portal-shell.html   200
/portal/*        /portal-shell.html   200
